{"id":27533,"author":"RATTLEWARRIOR","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eso recently, i got banned on the discord, and yeah. it was for spamming moderators for an unknown cause. i just want to express my love so the moderators, or atleast some of them. i also said that there\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003emight\u003c/i\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;be a hacker, so its not completely an unknown cause. i would lso like to say that a vlad was kicked for the same reason. but he only got kicked. he did just as much as i did. my \"warnings\", or whatever you call doing @moderator, was only like every other day, and i didnt do that very much, i also pinged the admins for a legit question. if this isnt appealable, then sorry, but for now, hi. how are you. i love you and have a good day.\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eso recently, i got banned on the discord, and yeah. it was for spamming moderators for an unknown cause. i just want to express my love so the moderators, or atleast some of them. i also said that there\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003emight\u003c/i\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;be a hacker, so its not completely an unknown cause. i would lso like to say that a vlad was kicked for the same reason. but he only got kicked. he did just as much as i did. my \"warnings\", or whatever you call doing @moderator, was only like every other day, and i didnt do that very much, i also pinged the admins for a legit question. if this isnt appealable, then sorry, but for now, hi. how are you. i love you and have a good day.\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1496795801,"title":"banned lmao","replies":[{"id":372062,"author":"shadowolfyt","body":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-7fb81ecb-8548-0cfd-fb2b-1819a99f7c03\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHey,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThanks for appealing. You were banned because in the past and also as of recent you have been pinging staff for no valid reason at all, an example [\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/F1jdS\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/F1jdS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e].\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\"I also said that there \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003emight\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e be a hacker, so it's not completely an unknown cause.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eI don't think 'might' is good enough you're just using it for a reason to ping staff for an unknown cause. If there is a hacker on state his name and what you think he is using.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\"i would lso like to say that a vlad was kicked for the same reason\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYes, he was [\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/6p0d4ak\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/6p0d4ak\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\"My \"warnings\", or whatever you call doing @moderator, was only like every other day\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou had many warnings and you were told many times to stop, I told you numerous times to stop and if you didn't you would be punished.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eI do not know how long ban periods are for Discord. I will get back to you on that other than that, this appeal has been denied.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-7fb81ecb-8548-0cfd-fb2b-1819a99f7c03\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHey,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThanks for appealing. You were banned because in the past and also as of recent you have been pinging staff for no valid reason at all, an example [\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/F1jdS\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/F1jdS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e].\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\"I also said that there \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003emight\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e be a hacker, so it's not completely an unknown cause.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eI don't think 'might' is good enough you're just using it for a reason to ping staff for an unknown cause. If there is a hacker on state his name and what you think he is using.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\"i would lso like to say that a vlad was kicked for the same reason\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYes, he was [\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/6p0d4ak\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/6p0d4ak\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\"My \"warnings\", or whatever you call doing @moderator, was only like every other day\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou had many warnings and you were told many times to stop, I told you numerous times to stop and if you didn't you would be punished.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eI do not know how long ban periods are for Discord. I will get back to you on that other than that, this appeal has been denied.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1496884721},{"id":372063,"author":"shadowolfyt","body":"I will leave this open for your further comment.","body_tagged":"I will leave this open for your further comment.","created_at":1496884738},{"id":372074,"author":"RATTLEWARRIOR","body":"can a dev make it so i get a notification for this?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei should of though of doing vlads idea\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei sorry\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ethanks,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-rattle","body_tagged":"can a dev make it so i get a notification for this?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei should of though of doing vlads idea\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei sorry\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ethanks,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-rattle","created_at":1496889588}]}